      "mergeID": "6ac7e07aed93e5dacc96ff97",
      "mergedPostDetails": "VRChat should implement a 5 Star Rating system which gives you the access to rate a world once you visit it at least once. That way the community can help each other not be baited into these low effort worlds with dishonest thumbnails or AI slop worlds. I'd say add a comment section as well, but I can see that opening a whole new section of moderation issues. A headache to moderate, but definitely not impossible to incorporate with a lot of text filters in place as well as explicit wording filters. Maybe give early access to people with over a select amount of VRChat hours (3000? 5000?) or make it the standard BAR requirement to get the feature enabled on your account. The best people to judge are those that have been around longer, and are more dedicated to the community, and recognize what is, and isn't good quality.",
