      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{66f5c3925bf17057c6ce7e38|full_name} There is an easy solution to that, \"Trust weighting\".\n\nVRC already has a Trust system for accounts. The lower you are on the Trust scale, the less your vote should influence the score, thus avoiding burner accounts having any real influence.\n\nVRC could also utilize additional data about the player's voting behavior to further shift their vote influence.\n\nIt makes logical sense that the more a person plays the game, the more their vote should have influence. It might not be a \"perfect\" solution, but rarely in life are there. But it's a reasonable solution that would mitigate issues *enough*.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
